      "number": "862",
      "text": "862. 把下面的商改写成积的形式：\n1) $\\frac{6}{7}:\\frac{3}{8}$；\n2) $\\frac{5}{12}:\\frac{10}{3}$；\n3) $\\frac{m}{k}:\\frac{c}{4}$；\n4) $\\frac{a}{b}:\\frac{c}{d}$；\n5) $\\frac{16}{12}:2$；\n6) $\\frac{5}{9}:\\frac{1}{3}$.",
