    },
    {
      "number": "863",
      "text": "863. 作除法：\n1) $\\frac{3}{8}:\\frac{7}{5}$；\n2) $\\frac{1}{5}:\\frac{9}{4}$；\n3) $\\frac{4}{5}:\\frac{4}{7}$；\n4) $\\frac{3}{16}:\\frac{5}{4}$；\n5) $\\frac{3}{5}:\\frac{9}{25}$；\n6) $-\\frac{3}{25}:\\left(-\\frac{9}{5}\\right)$.",
